---
layout: base.njk
title: Digital Surveillance Resource Guide
permalink: /guide.html
---

<main>
  <h1>Digital Surveillance Resource Guide</h1>

  <p>
    This guide introduces digital surveillance technology and explores
    how it affects privacy, law enforcement, and public safety.
    It is designed for people who are new to the topic.
  </p>

  {% for section in collections.section | sort(attribute="data.order") %}
    <section>
      <h2>{{ section.data.title }}</h2>

      {% if section.data.image %}
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ section.data.image }}"
               alt="{{ section.data.image_alt }}">
          <figcaption>{{ section.data.image_credit }}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      {% endif %}

      {{ section.templateContent | safe }}
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</main>